2. \`src/request.js\`: Changes \`buildReviewRequest\`.
3. \`scripts/measure.js\`: Source change (+1 −1).
4. \`test/request.test.js\`: Test updates for this change.
5. \`test/reader.test.js\`: Test updates for this change.

