- **test**: Edits \`reader.test.js\` and \`request.test.js\`.
- **src**: Changes \`runReader\` and \`buildReviewRequest\`.
- **scripts**: Edits \`measure.js\`.

**Review focus**

- \`src/reader.js\`: Changes \`runReader\`.
- \`src/request.js\`: Changes \`buildReviewRequest\`.

**Testing**

- 4 test cases added across 2 test files
"
`;

