"# Covi brief: Keep accented letters and collapse repeated separators

Run \`20260901-090000-analyze-0000000\` · bugfix-cli-slugify · main \`c536c89\` → HEAD \`ecd0697\` · 2 files, +13 −1 · size small

## Author description

**fix(slugify): keep accented letters and collapse repeated separators**

> The description is the author’s claim, not evidence. Verify it against the code.

## Commits

- \`ecd0697\` fix(slugify): keep accented letters and collapse repeated separators

## What Covi determined

- **Intent:** bug-fix (high confidence). title "fix(slugify): keep accented letters and collapse repeated separators" uses the fix prefix; commit "fix(slugify): keep accented letters and collapse repeated separators"; branch name "fix/slugify-accents"
- **Areas:** test (test); src (internal)
- **Surfaces:** test (1)
- **Demonstration value:** high (cli) → video. 
- **Can run the app:** yes (commands)
- **Tests:** 1 test file changed (+2 cases); frameworks: node:test

## Suggested reading order

1. \`src/slugify.js\`: Changes \`slugify\`.
2. \`test/slugify.test.js\`: Test updates for this change.

## Diff (prioritized)

### src/slugify.js · modified · +5 −1 · source

\`\`\`diff
@@ -1,8 +1,12 @@
 /**
  * Turns a title into a URL-friendly slug.
+ * Accented letters keep their base letter ("é" → "e"); runs of separators collapse into one dash.
  */
 export function slugify(text) {
   return text
+    .normalize('NFKD')
+    .replace(/[̀-ͯ]/g, '')
     .toLowerCase()
-    .replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, '-');
+    .replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, '-')
+    .replace(/^-+|-+$/g, '');
 }
\`\`\`

### test/slugify.test.js · modified · +8 −0 · test

\`\`\`diff
@@ -5,3 +5,11 @@ import { slugify } from '../src/slugify.js';
 test('lowercases and joins words with dashes', () => {
   assert.equal(slugify('Hello World'), 'hello-world');
 });
+
+test('keeps accented letters as their base letter', () => {
+  assert.equal(slugify('Héllo Wörld'), 'hello-world');
+});
+
+test('collapses repeated separators and trims the ends', () => {
+  assert.equal(slugify('  Ça va?  Oui!! '), 'ca-va-oui');
+});
\`\`\`

