"# Demonstration

## Page / (desktop)

Before: ![before](../demo/screenshots/home-desktop-before.png)

After: ![after](../demo/screenshots/home-desktop-after.png)

Changed pixels: 4.00%

## compose · step 1: Type a comment (desktop)

After: ![after](../demo/screenshots/flow-0.png)

## compose · step 2: Counter updates as you type (desktop)

After: ![after](../demo/screenshots/flow-1.png)

## compose · step 3: Post the comment (desktop)

After: ![after](../demo/screenshots/flow-2.png)

## GET /api/users

Before: HTTP 200 · After: HTTP 200 · changed

Shape change: the response changed from a JSON array to a JSON object with keys items, nextCursor.

## \`node cli.js "Hello World"\`

Before:

\`\`\`
Error: bad input

\`\`\`

After:

\`\`\`
hello-world

\`\`\`

## Recordings

- Load items at base: [flow-load-items-base.webm](../demo/recordings/flow-load-items-base.webm)
- Load items at head: [flow-load-items-head.webm](../demo/recordings/flow-load-items-head.webm)

Recordings are WebM because ffmpeg was not found. Install ffmpeg, or set COVI_FFMPEG, to get MP4.

## Behavior at base and head

### Load items (desktop)

- Step 2 (“Open the menu”): failed at base, completed at head.
- The final frame (“Load items”) looks different: 1.23% of pixels changed ([diff](../demo/diffs/flow-load-items-end.png)).
- \`GET /items.json?session=[REDACTED]\`: HTTP 200 at base, HTTP 404 at head
- New request: \`GET /api/limits\` → HTTP 200
- No longer requested: \`GET /legacy.js\` (HTTP 200 at base)
- New console error: \`Could not load items: HTTP 404\`
- Console error no longer logged: \`Deprecated API\`
- Step 1 took 1200 ms at head and 300 ms at base.

### Checkout (mobile)

- Not compared: it ran only at head.
- Failed at head: \`locator.click: Timeout 8000ms exceeded\`

1 scenario behaved the same at base and head.

## Not demonstrated

- tablet viewport: not configured
"
