exports[`English output (baseline) > ui-comment-composer > writes the same rule findings, explanation, and reports > brief.md 1`] = `
"# Covi brief: Show remaining characters and block overlong comments

Run \`20260901-090000-analyze-0000000\` · ui-comment-composer · main \`e2bb0a4\` → HEAD \`1b6e741\` · 3 files, +30 −3 · size small

## Author description

**feat(comments): show remaining characters and block overlong comments**

> The description is the author’s claim, not evidence. Verify it against the code.

## Commits

- \`1b6e741\` feat(comments): show remaining characters and block overlong comments

## What Covi determined

- **Intent:** feature (high confidence). title "feat(comments): show remaining characters and block overlong comments" uses the feat prefix; commit "feat(comments): show remaining characters and block overlong comments"; branch name "feat/comment-counter"
- **Areas:** project root (ui)
- **Surfaces:** ui (2)
- **Demonstration value:** high (visual, ui, interaction) → video. A stylesheet changes, which is best judged by looking at it.
- **Can run the app:** yes (static)
- **Tests:** no test changes

## Suggested reading order

1. \`app.js\`: Adds \`LIMIT\`, \`WARN_AT\`, and \`counter\`.
2. \`index.html\`: Markup change (+3 −2).
3. \`styles.css\`: Style change (+4 −0).

## Diff (prioritized)

### app.js · modified · +23 −1 · source

\`\`\`diff
@@ -1,11 +1,30 @@
+const LIMIT = 280;
+const WARN_AT = 20;
+
 const form = document.getElementById('composer');
 const input = document.getElementById('comment');
 const list = document.getElementById('comment-list');
+const counter = document.getElementById('counter');
+const post = document.getElementById('post');
+
+function remaining() {
+  return LIMIT - input.value.trim().length;
+}
+
+function updateCounter() {
+  const left = remaining();
+  counter.textContent = left >= 0 ? \`\${left} characters left\` : \`\${-left} characters over the limit\`;
+  counter.classList.toggle('warn', left >= 0 && left <= WARN_AT);
+  counter.classList.toggle('over', left < 0);
+  post.disabled = input.value.trim().length === 0 || left < 0;
+}
+
+input.addEventListener('input', updateCounter);
 
 form.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
   event.preventDefault();
   const text = input.value.trim();
-  if (!text) return;
+  if (!text || remaining() < 0) return;
   const item = document.createElement('li');
   item.innerHTML = '<strong>You</strong>';
   const body = document.createElement('p');
@@ -13,4 +32,7 @@ form.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
   item.appendChild(body);
   list.appendChild(item);
   input.value = '';
+  updateCounter();
 });
+
+updateCounter();
\`\`\`

### index.html · modified · +3 −2 · markup

\`\`\`diff
@@ -19,9 +19,10 @@
       </ul>
       <form class="composer" id="composer">
         <label for="comment">Add a comment</label>
-        <textarea id="comment" name="comment" rows="4" placeholder="Share your thoughts…"></textarea>
+        <textarea id="comment" name="comment" rows="4" maxlength="400" placeholder="Share your thoughts…" aria-describedby="counter"></textarea>
         <div class="composer-footer">
-          <button id="post" type="submit">Post</button>
+          <span id="counter" class="counter" aria-live="polite">280 characters left</span>
+          <button id="post" type="submit" disabled>Post</button>
         </div>
       </form>
     </section>
\`\`\`

### styles.css · modified · +4 −0 · style

\`\`\`diff
@@ -16,3 +16,7 @@ h1 { font-size: 34px; margin: 8px 0 12px; }
 .composer textarea { width: 100%; border: 1px solid #cfd5e1; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; font: inherit; resize: vertical; }
 .composer-footer { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 10px; }
 #post { background: #2563eb; color: #fff; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 18px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
+.counter { color: #6b7385; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
+.counter.warn { color: #b45309; font-weight: 600; }
+.counter.over { color: #b42318; font-weight: 600; }
+#post:disabled { background: #a9b8e6; cursor: not-allowed; }
\`\`\`

## Next steps for the agent

Artifacts live in \`.covi/runs/20260901-090000-analyze-0000000\`.

