"# Covi brief: Refresh plan cards and highlight the popular plan

Run \`20260901-090000-analyze-0000000\` · visual-pricing-cards · main \`7ca31b1\` → HEAD \`977d875\` · 2 files, +15 −10 · size small

## Author description

**style(pricing): refresh plan cards and highlight the popular plan**

> The description is the author’s claim, not evidence. Verify it against the code.

## Commits

- \`977d875\` style(pricing): refresh plan cards and highlight the popular plan

## What Covi determined

- **Intent:** visual (high confidence). title "style(pricing): refresh plan cards and highlight the popular plan" uses the style prefix; commit "style(pricing): refresh plan cards and highlight the popular plan"; branch name "design/pricing-refresh"
- **Areas:** project root (ui)
- **Surfaces:** ui (2)
- **Demonstration value:** high (visual, ui) → video. A stylesheet changes, which is best judged by looking at it.
- **Can run the app:** yes (static)
- **Tests:** no test changes

## Signals worth checking

- **[focus-outline-removed-80d64bbad28e]** Likely issue · medium: Focus outline removed in pricing.css (\`pricing.css:16\`)

Rule findings are evidence-based but shallow. Confirm or dismiss each one (with a reason) in findings.json.

## Suggested reading order

1. \`index.html\`: Markup change (+3 −2).
2. \`pricing.css\`: Style change (+12 −8).

## Diff (prioritized)

### index.html · modified · +3 −2 · markup

\`\`\`diff
@@ -17,11 +17,12 @@
         <ul><li>3 dashboards</li><li>7-day history</li><li>Community support</li></ul>
